		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Free Action (1 scrap):</strong> Gain advantage on your next roll.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> Your next roll is considered 2 higher. A roll over a die's maximum is a crit.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can see in the dark.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using the gadget spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] The Toolbelt upgrade is the separate \"Utility Goggles (Toolbelt)\" feature (2 scraps total); the passive lives on the \"Utility Goggles\" gadget feature, so it works even if this item is unequipped.</em></p><p><em>[A] Keep the gadget equipped: Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules, so its scrap cost would not be charged.</em></p><p><em>[M] Take advantage on your next roll.</em></p>",
